Package: tflspec
Title: Excel Specifications for Clinical Tables, Listings and Figures
Version: 0.0.15
Authors@R: person("ichirio", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ichi.r.pro@gmail.com")
Description: Reads study specifications written in Excel and produces what a
    clinical TFL report is made of. Tables: 'cards'/'cardx' analysis results
    data (ARD) are normalized and laid out through a declarative plan or a
    table specification, then rendered by 'rtfreporter'. Figures: skeleton
    'ggplot2' code is generated from a plot specification; that code depends
    only on 'ggplot2' and the relevant extension packages, not on 'tflspec'
    (treatment-sequence Sankey diagrams and sunbursts, drawn by 'tflspec'
    functions built on 'ggplot2', are the exception).
